# Test PlantBot API endpoints

### Health Check - Get API Documentation
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs
Accept: application/json

###

### Chat Endpoint - Test with a simple message
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What are some good indoor plants for beginners?"
}

###

### Chat Endpoint - Test with another message
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "How often should I water a succulent?"
}

###
